<rml>
<head>
	<title>Golden Archer</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="docked_panel_frame.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="rena_shop.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<!-- The Golden Archer's Rena shop window (CRenaShopWindow), opened by the Golden Archer (NPC 236), docked right at
	     full dock height, built like the Endless Tower window: the title, the Rena balance and the Rena in the bag, the
	     button that hands the bag's Rena in; then one counter-scaled pane with three tabs (shop, Golden Arrow,
	     progress; the shown one gold) and the shown tab's lines (by kind: 1 a title, 2 green, 3 red, 4 bold gold,
	     5 continuing the line above, 6 grey; a shop line can be picked, the picked one on a gold band); a second pane at
	     the foot with the last answer (green or red) or why the buttons are off, and on the shop and Golden Arrow tabs
	     the two buttons (buy 1 / 5, spin 1 / 10); and the exit button. The workspace slot places and scales #panel.
	     C++ keeps the state and checks every click; clicks are queued with rena_shop_tab(tab), rena_shop_row(item),
	     rena_shop_act(count), rena_shop_give and rena_shop_exit. -->
	<div id="panel" data-model="rena_shop">
		<div class="frame-piece frame-top"></div>
		<div class="frame-piece frame-left"></div>
		<div class="frame-piece frame-right"></div>
		<div class="frame-piece frame-bottom"></div>

		<span id="rs_title" class="sharp-text rs-title"
		      data-style-font-size="title.text_px + 'px'">{{title.text}}</span>
		<span id="rs_balance" class="sharp-text rs-balance"
		      data-style-font-size="balance.text_px + 'px'">{{balance.text}}</span>
		<span id="rs_bag" class="sharp-text rs-bag"
		      data-style-font-size="bag.text_px + 'px'">{{bag.text}}</span>

		<div id="rs_head" class="sharp-text sharp-flow">
			<div id="rs_give" data-if="give_label.text != ''" data-class-off="!can_give"
			     data-event-click="rena_shop_give">
				<span class="rs-btn-label" data-style-font-size="give_label.text_px + 'px'">{{give_label.text}}</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="rs_list" class="sharp-text sharp-flow">
			<div class="rs-tabs">
				<div class="rs-tab" data-for="t : tabs" data-class-selected="t.selected"
				     data-event-click="rena_shop_tab(t.tab)">
					<span class="rs-tab-label" data-style-font-size="t.label.text_px + 'px'">{{t.label.text}}</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<span class="rs-row" data-for="r : rows" data-class-title="r.kind == 1" data-class-good="r.kind == 2"
			      data-class-bad="r.kind == 3" data-class-name="r.kind == 4" data-class-more="r.kind == 5"
			      data-class-dim="r.kind == 6" data-class-pick="r.item >= 0" data-class-selected="r.selected"
			      data-event-click="rena_shop_row(r.item)"
			      data-style-font-size="r.text.text_px + 'px'">{{r.text.text}}</span>
		</div>

		<div id="rs_foot" class="sharp-text sharp-flow">
			<span class="rs-hint" data-for="h : hint" data-class-good="hint_kind == 1" data-class-bad="hint_kind == 2"
			      data-style-font-size="h.text_px + 'px'">{{h.text}}</span>

			<div id="rs_buttons" data-if="show_buttons">
				<div class="rs-act-btn" data-class-off="!can_first" data-event-click="rena_shop_act(1)">
					<span class="rs-btn-label" data-style-font-size="first_label.text_px + 'px'">{{first_label.text}}</span>
				</div>
				<div class="rs-act-btn" data-class-off="!can_second" data-event-click="rena_shop_act(second_count)">
					<span class="rs-btn-label" data-style-font-size="second_label.text_px + 'px'">{{second_label.text}}</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="btn_exit" data-event-click="rena_shop_exit" data-attr-data-hint="exit_tooltip"></div>
		<div id="frame_corner_close" data-event-click="rena_shop_exit"></div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
